    "description": "This dataset contains bathymetry (water depth), ship's heading, ship's speed and position data collected during the Nella Dan Voyage 1 1985-86. This was a marine science voyage departing Hobart, visiting Heard Island, beset at Amundsen Bay and returning to Hobart. Data are available online via the Australian Antarctic Division Data Centre web page (or via the Related URL given below). For further information, see the Marine Science Support Voyage Report at the Related URL below.",
